 href='https://tossug.org/' target='_blank'>Website<\\/a><\\/div>\",\"<h4>South Asia<\\/h4><p><b>1 communities<\\/b><\\/p><div style='max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto;'><b>Open Source India<\\/b><br>India's largest open source conference and community<br><a href='https://opensourceindia.in/' target='_blank'>Website<\\/a><\\/div>\",\"<h4>Southeast Asia<\\/h4><p><b>1 communities<\\/b><\\/p><div style='max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto;'><b>FOSSASIA<\\/b><br>Open source community in Asia focusing on open source software and hardware<br><a href='https://fossasia.org/' target='_blank'>Website<\\/a><\\/div>\"],null,null,{\"interactive\":false,\"permanent\":false,\"direction\":\"auto\",\"opacity\":1,\"offset\":[0,0],\"textsize\":\"10px\",\"textOnly\":false,\"className\":\"\",\"sticky\":true},null]},{\"method\":\"addLegend\",\"args\":[{\"colors\":[\"red\",\"blue\",\"green\",\"purple\"],\"labels\":[\"East Asia\",\"Southeast Asia\",\"South Asia\",\"Central Asia\"],\"na_color\":null,\"na_label\":\"NA\",\"opacity\":0.7,\"position\":\"bottomright\",\"type\":\"unknown\",\"title\":\"Regions\",\"extra\":null,\"layerId\":null,\"className\":\"info legend\",\"group\":null}]}],\"setView\":[[25,100],4,[]],\"limits\":{\"lat\":[10,35],\"lng\":[80,115]}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## How to Contribute\n\nWe welcome new community submissions! To add your community:\n\n1. Create a GitHub Issue using our template\n2. Fill in your community details\n3. Our team will review and add your community to the database\n\nFor more details, see our [Contribution Guidelines](CONTRIBUTING.md). ",
